WEBVTT

00:00:09.950 --> 00:00:13.620
Kana, what pretty black hair you have.

00:00:13.620 --> 00:00:17.120
Just like your father's.

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.660
I wish my hair was bright
and shiny, like yours, Mama.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:25.370
Mama! Mama!

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:28.500
Oh, my, look who's awake.

00:00:33.120 --> 00:00:35.250
There, there...

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:38.950
Yumemi has nice hair, just like Mama.

00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:43.830
Kana, don't be like that.
You're going to make me sad.

00:00:44.830 --> 00:00:48.750
Yumemi would be sad
if you said that to her, too.

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.000
Yumemi loves her big sister, after all.

00:00:55.700 --> 00:00:57.330
I get it.

00:00:58.620 --> 00:01:02.870
I don't hate having black hair.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:04.330
Still...

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:21.500
<i>Tell me, do you remember?</i>

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.410
<i>Yes, the wondrous God-given power you have,</i>

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:31.250
<i>like sleight of hand without any tricks?</i>

00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:35.040
<i>Tell me, have you already forgotten?</i>

00:01:35.040 --> 00:01:38.200
<i>Those dreamlike, heart-shaped</i>

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:43.580
<i>flower-bouquet-like words of yours?</i>

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:49.830
<i>I'm sure, I'm sure</i>

00:01:49.830 --> 00:01:53.500
<i>this key will open your treasure box</i>

00:01:53.500 --> 00:01:59.750
<i>and let you remember them tonight</i>

00:01:59.750 --> 00:02:02.620
<i>Farewell!</i>

00:02:02.620 --> 00:02:03.910
<i>Watch me now,</i>

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:07.120
<i>I'm gently, quietly going to disappear,</i>

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:09.040
<i>so find me</i>

00:02:09.040 --> 00:02:10.250
<i>I'm over here</i>

00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:15.370
<i>Our long, long night of secrets is beginning</i>

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:16.660
<i>Come after me</i>

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:21.830
<i>Once you see the twinkle of my tearstains,</i>

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:24.700
<i>catch me with your voice</i>

00:02:24.700 --> 00:02:29.410
<i>and the magic words only the two of us know</i>

00:02:39.040 --> 00:02:41.750
My, my, what a grim face.

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:46.200
What do you mean, Mother
might be able to come back, Auntie?

00:02:46.200 --> 00:02:51.330
Stop calling me "Auntie"!
I'm going to lose my interest in talking to you.

00:02:51.330 --> 00:02:53.700
How about "Mariah-<i>san</i>" then?

00:02:53.700 --> 00:02:56.000
That will do.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.120
That...

00:03:02.120 --> 00:03:04.410
...has Mama's crest on it.

00:03:04.410 --> 00:03:11.200
I see you noticed. This is an Artifact
that she created--Nagarjuna.

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:16.950
I have been sent by Mother Morrigan
here to Japan to retrieve it.

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:22.040
Tell me,

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:25.160
would you go and retrieve it in my place?

00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:30.040
Why me? You should be able
to get it easily enough, right?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:33.540
Because Tominozawa is
quite the pain in the neck.

00:03:33.540 --> 00:03:38.700
Besides, it's not as though I have
some do-anything Artifact, myself.

00:03:41.870 --> 00:03:46.410
As I remember, you called it "Muff-<i>kun</i>," right?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:50.370
If you have that, then taking back
an Artifact and keeping it safe

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:57.080
isn't that great a chore.
That is the reason why she let you have it.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.040
Once I return with Nagarjuna,

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:03.750
I think Mother Morrigan will reconcile
with Maeve-<i>neesan </i>and let her go.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:07.160
When that happens,
I'll put in a good word, as well.

00:04:08.870 --> 00:04:13.910
Are you sure? If I do that, are you
sure that Mama can come home?

00:04:15.000 --> 00:04:16.370
Yes.

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:30.080
Hey! Kikyouin!

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:34.870
Sorry to keep you, Kikyouin.
Today's a great day for a date, isn't it?

00:04:36.580 --> 00:04:39.160
What did you do that for, Kikyouin?

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:40.790
I'm teaching you a lesson,

00:04:40.790 --> 00:04:44.500
so you guys don't start thinking
you're better than you are.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.120
S-Sorry. I'll be more careful from now on.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.040
Hayashida, did you bring it?

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:53.040
Yes. I have it right here, of course.

00:04:54.370 --> 00:04:55.790
What's that?

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:58.540
The blueprints for the art gallery.

00:04:58.540 --> 00:05:03.160
Listen up. You two are going
to look around the art gallery,

00:05:03.160 --> 00:05:06.790
and you're going to mark down
every last location on here

00:05:06.790 --> 00:05:10.040
where there's a security guard
or camera. Got it?

00:05:10.040 --> 00:05:12.160
--Yes, ma'am!
--Yes, ma'am!

00:05:17.700 --> 00:05:20.750
Hmm, this place is more popular than I expected.

00:05:20.750 --> 00:05:22.950
They charge a ridiculously high entrance fee,

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:27.500
so they must be making a small fortune.
Maybe I should do this, too.

00:05:27.500 --> 00:05:32.500
Hey, that's not the reason we're looking
around, remember-- Found it! Over there!

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:38.450
Well? Do you see it?

00:05:38.450 --> 00:05:40.830
Mm-hmm, no doubt about it.

00:05:49.660 --> 00:05:51.500
Do you have a positive ID?

00:05:51.500 --> 00:05:53.620
That's the genuine item, all right.

00:05:53.620 --> 00:05:56.450
Then there's no need to stick around.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:03.660
So what do we do? Go for it?
But we can't do it on our own, right?

00:06:03.660 --> 00:06:04.950
I know.

00:06:04.950 --> 00:06:09.330
Our coming here to look around was a secret.
We can't do something like that.

00:06:09.330 --> 00:06:11.580
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:14.790
Once Maeve-<i>san </i>gets back, we'll discuss it.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:18.500
We're dealing with someone
more than just a little dangerous.

00:06:18.500 --> 00:06:21.200
Kokomi, I'm sorry to have
to involve you in this.

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.330
I just had to see it for myself.

00:06:23.330 --> 00:06:30.410
Oh, no, that's fine. I was glad that
you asked me for help, Hatena.

00:06:40.750 --> 00:06:43.290
Help me, Makoto-<i>niisama</i>!

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:46.700
Whoa, hold on, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>!

00:06:46.700 --> 00:06:50.500
Yumemi-<i>sama</i>, running away
and hiding will not help.

00:06:52.790 --> 00:06:54.660
What's going on, Ema-<i>san</i>?

00:06:54.660 --> 00:07:00.700
Yumemi-<i>sama </i>absolutely refuses to take
a bath, and I am trying to convince her.

00:07:00.700 --> 00:07:04.500
Not true. She tried to forcibly undress me.

00:07:04.500 --> 00:07:08.160
There may have been some slight
misunderstanding about that.

00:07:08.160 --> 00:07:12.620
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, I think it's
a good idea to bathe regularly.

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.790
Come, Yumemi-<i>sama</i>, let's go take that bath.

00:07:17.910 --> 00:07:23.290
I know. Once you finish taking
your bath, I'll give you a reward.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.910
A reward?

00:07:24.910 --> 00:07:29.120
Mm-hmm. Something within my control, I mean.

00:07:30.540 --> 00:07:35.160
I saw on the Internet that there's
a temple nearby where you can meditate.

00:07:35.160 --> 00:07:38.120
I'd like you to take me there.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.040
That's fine. But why do you want to meditate?

00:07:41.040 --> 00:07:47.000
I want to be able to control my mind.
I'm going to train myself in meditation.

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:49.790
You mean to keep your magic under control?

00:07:49.790 --> 00:07:52.120
Mm-hmm. I think that if I can do that,

00:07:52.120 --> 00:07:55.290
I can keep my magic from unintentionally
going into the things I make

00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.290
and turning into Artifacts
when I don't mean them to be.

00:07:58.290 --> 00:08:03.370
Oh. Okay, you got it.
Well, you take a bath and get cleaned up,

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:05.160
and we'll go there tomorrow.

00:08:05.160 --> 00:08:06.370
Mm-hmm.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:08.250
I'll take a bath.

00:08:15.160 --> 00:08:20.040
I-Imagine, Mistress Yumemi
willingly going to take a bath!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:24.790
Moreover, she is going outside
tomorrow! How wonderful!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:28.000
Our shut-in young lady is going out!

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:32.580
Makoto-<i>sama</i>, thank you so much for this.

00:08:32.580 --> 00:08:35.290
I must hurry along and get some
clothes ready for her to wear outside!

00:08:35.290 --> 00:08:39.750
No, before that, I need to get
Yumemi-<i>sama </i>scrubbed head to toe!

00:08:45.910 --> 00:08:48.040
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, sorry to keep you.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:50.580
Just a moment, please, Mistress Yumemi!

00:08:50.580 --> 00:08:54.750
You cannot go outside dressed
like that. Please change into this.

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:04.660
Hmm, you can see her underwear
when she sits to meditate in that dress.

00:09:04.660 --> 00:09:06.580
That's okay.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:10.200
I'm not wearing underwear,
so no one will see them. It's okay.

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.660
No, it is <i>not </i>okay!

00:09:28.500 --> 00:09:32.870
"30 minutes later..."

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:36.580
Your legs went numb after just that? Pathetic.

00:09:36.580 --> 00:09:39.540
Aw, how embarrassing.

00:09:39.540 --> 00:09:44.040
I have to admit, I'm surprised your
family runs this temple, Hayashida.

00:09:44.040 --> 00:09:49.450
Oh, I'm the one who is surprised
that you all would come here like this.

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:52.580
Kikyouin-<i>san </i>and Tokichiro,
what brought you here?

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:59.330
These two helped Hatena out with
a favor, so I came here to thank them.

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:01.250
A favor for Hatena?

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:04.200
What was it?

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:10.700
Oh, no! She told me to keep it a secret.
Can you pretend you didn't hear that?

00:10:12.910 --> 00:10:15.660
Please, tell me.

00:10:17.410 --> 00:10:21.700
Well, um, w-we went to go
see the Tominozawa Collection.

00:10:21.700 --> 00:10:25.120
Hoshisato-<i>san </i>said she was interested
in the art gallery's architecture,

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:26.950
so we checked out the building's construction,

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:27.790
--the location of the
security cameras, and stuff...

00:10:27.790 --> 00:10:29.540
--The Tominozawa Collection?
--the location of the
security cameras, and stuff...

00:10:29.540 --> 00:10:30.040
--The Tominozawa Collection?

00:10:30.040 --> 00:10:31.410
Kikyouin-<i>san</i>!

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:36.040
Aw, man, you stupid boys!
Why did you say anything?

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:39.290
It's all right. She just wanted
to make sure it was the real item.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:42.500
She also said there was nothing
she could do about it herself.

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:47.450
And the Kikyouin family goofed up
before, so I couldn't turn her down.

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.000
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>...

00:10:49.000 --> 00:10:52.410
Mm-hmm, let's talk to Jeeves-<i>san </i>and Ema-<i>san</i>.

00:10:52.620 --> 00:10:55.620
"Closed"

00:11:06.370 --> 00:11:08.500
It can't be! Why?!

00:11:08.500 --> 00:11:11.700
Is this what you were looking for?

00:11:12.910 --> 00:11:16.080
I'm here to get that Artifact back!

00:11:16.080 --> 00:11:21.540
Get it back? What a funny thing to say.
This belongs to me.

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:26.750
That thing wrapped around your
neck is also destined to be mine.

00:11:29.160 --> 00:11:31.660
Seize her, Tomi-Tomi Slime!

00:11:31.660 --> 00:11:35.000
Gah! What is this?!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:39.410
This is my Artifact, Tomi-Tomi Slime.

00:11:39.410 --> 00:11:42.040
Muff-<i>kun</i>, save me!

00:11:43.080 --> 00:11:45.620
You can stop your pointless struggling.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:50.910
Now, let's go have a long chat
someplace where no one will bother us.

00:11:52.000 --> 00:11:54.410
Oh, are you back already?

00:11:54.410 --> 00:11:56.330
Ema-<i>san</i>, where is Hatena?

00:11:56.330 --> 00:12:00.200
Huh? The mistress is not here right now.

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:10.830
Now that you've brought me here,
what are you planning to do?

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:14.910
Like I said, have a nice long chat.

00:12:14.910 --> 00:12:18.250
I don't have anything to say to you!

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:23.200
Such a harsh tongue.
Perhaps you need a little spanking.

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:27.750
Tomi-Tomi Slime-<i>chan</i>, warm her up nice and hot.

00:12:36.120 --> 00:12:39.370
Muff-<i>kun</i>, do something!

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:44.000
I knew things would end up like this.

00:12:45.580 --> 00:12:47.540
Aunt... ie...

00:12:47.540 --> 00:12:49.950
I've asked you not to call me that, haven't I?

00:12:49.950 --> 00:12:54.370
But why? Why are you here, Aunt-- Mariah-<i>san</i>?

00:12:54.370 --> 00:13:00.290
I have made a deal with Mariah-<i>san</i>,
in return for a payoff--

00:13:00.290 --> 00:13:05.000
a deal to be presented with the
practical magician Maeve's masterpiece.

00:13:06.580 --> 00:13:10.500
What is the meaning of this?
You said that if I got back the Nagarjuna,

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:14.410
you would put in a word to let Mother come home.

00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:19.870
I wasn't lying about that. I'd put in
a word <i>after </i>you stole the Nagarjuna.

00:13:19.870 --> 00:13:21.160
But...!

00:13:21.160 --> 00:13:25.200
Besides, I never said I wouldn't
tell her you were coming.

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:26.410
This can't be...

00:13:26.410 --> 00:13:31.120
Still, I'm disappointed. I thought you,
who possessed my sister's masterpiece,

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:33.910
would be able to fare a little better than this.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:39.290
Your muffler moves according to your will.

00:13:39.290 --> 00:13:42.540
You have not issued
instructions to your Artifact.

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:45.540
You have not mastered it at all.

00:13:46.620 --> 00:13:53.700
Now, I hate to see you looking as
pitiful as this, so I'll be leaving now.

00:13:53.700 --> 00:13:59.200
W-Wait, Mariah-<i>san</i>! You... You can't do this!

00:14:04.830 --> 00:14:06.370
P-<i>chan</i>...

00:14:06.370 --> 00:14:10.250
Artifact search. Where is Muff-<i>kun</i>?

00:14:14.910 --> 00:14:20.450
Found it. Sure enough, it's where
the Tominozawa Collection is on display.

00:14:20.450 --> 00:14:24.370
I'm picking up Muff-<i>kun</i>. But this is strange.

00:14:24.370 --> 00:14:28.250
There isn't any corresponding
location in the gallery's blueprints.

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.950
What's more, the readings aren't moving at all.

00:14:30.950 --> 00:14:34.040
It is probably a hidden room or something.

00:14:34.040 --> 00:14:37.080
I think it best to consider that
Kana-<i>sama </i>has been captured.

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:38.750
Gau!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:41.410
We are going to have to go and get her.

00:14:41.410 --> 00:14:44.200
She really is a high-maintenance young lady.

00:14:44.200 --> 00:14:45.700
I'm coming, too.

00:14:45.700 --> 00:14:47.330
So am I.

00:14:47.330 --> 00:14:53.660
Yumemi-<i>chan</i>, we'll go. You should
stay here and use P-<i>chan </i>to back us up.

00:14:53.660 --> 00:14:54.950
--I'm going!
--Gau!

00:14:54.950 --> 00:14:58.500
It's too dangerous.
Hatena herself could have been captured.

00:14:58.500 --> 00:15:02.160
That's why I'm going! Makoto-<i>niisama</i>,
you have to understand.

00:15:03.160 --> 00:15:08.620
I'm sure the reason big sister
went out on a limb is because of me.

00:15:10.290 --> 00:15:15.660
I think big sister...
has trouble dealing with me.

00:15:17.120 --> 00:15:21.000
I think Hatena loves you, though.

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:24.660
I don't mean she dislikes me;
she's awkward with me.

00:15:24.660 --> 00:15:28.450
I should know. I'm the same way.

00:15:28.450 --> 00:15:30.950
But I also love her, too.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:32.200
So...

00:15:32.200 --> 00:15:33.660
Nonetheless...

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:36.580
If I may weigh in,

00:15:36.580 --> 00:15:40.620
if you are going to settle this,
the sooner the better.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:47.540
This is a disguise that
I prepared for you, Yumemi-<i>sama</i>.

00:15:47.540 --> 00:15:50.660
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, when did you come up
with something like that?

00:15:50.660 --> 00:15:56.370
I sewed it together last night, in case
Yumemi-<i>sama </i>said she wanted it.

00:15:56.370 --> 00:16:00.870
Jeeves-<i>san</i>, you give your blessing to
Yumemi-<i>chan </i>going to rescue Hatena?

00:16:00.870 --> 00:16:04.120
If asked, I am against it,

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:08.000
but Yumemi-<i>sama</i>,
do you wish to know what I think?

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:16.620
Very well, then. The car is ready for you.

00:16:22.120 --> 00:16:27.750
My, my, we certainly have become
a disgraceful sight, haven't we?

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:37.250
Now, why don't you turn over
your Artifact to me, already?

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:40.500
Do that, and I will release you at once.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:44.790
And of course, I will overlook the fact
that you came in here to steal from me.

00:16:44.790 --> 00:16:51.660
No way... After all, Mother
entrusted Muff-<i>kun </i>to me...

00:16:51.660 --> 00:16:54.660
My, what an obstinate girl you are!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:59.200
In that case, let me make
it even hotter for you.

00:17:11.120 --> 00:17:13.500
This has gone far enough!

00:17:13.500 --> 00:17:14.660
Yumemi...

00:17:14.660 --> 00:17:17.700
Huh? Ah! Hatena!

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:22.080
Makoto...

00:17:22.080 --> 00:17:25.120
How could you do this to Hatena?

00:17:25.120 --> 00:17:27.910
How dare you hurt big sister?!

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:31.750
You will pay for doing harm to Mistress Kana!

00:17:31.750 --> 00:17:37.410
You people! But this place
has impenetrable security!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:41.330
I brought down all of your security with P-<i>chan</i>.

00:17:41.330 --> 00:17:45.500
I had your security personnel
all take a little nap.

00:17:45.500 --> 00:17:49.040
H-How could you do this?!

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:55.000
Smile Stick!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:56.790
Levitation!

00:18:01.000 --> 00:18:01.870
Ema-<i>san</i>!

00:18:01.870 --> 00:18:05.700
Oh! That wand is an Artifact, too, isn't it?!

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:14.200
Ema-<i>san</i>!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:18.040
Do not worry... This is nothing...

00:18:19.040 --> 00:18:23.250
You will not escape from
Tomi-Tomi Slime so easily.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:26.620
Now, time for you to learn your lesson!

00:18:29.410 --> 00:18:31.290
Oh, no!

00:18:32.580 --> 00:18:35.250
That maid uniform is
likely an Artifact, as well,

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:38.950
but its core would seem to be that brooch.

00:18:38.950 --> 00:18:42.750
I think I will take that.

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:44.620
How do you know that?

00:18:44.620 --> 00:18:49.080
Do you have any idea how long
I have been pursuing Artifacts?

00:18:49.080 --> 00:18:51.950
I'm a whole different generation.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:53.950
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>,

00:18:53.950 --> 00:18:57.160
she's controlling that
sticky stuff with that bottle.

00:18:57.160 --> 00:19:01.790
If we get it away from her,
she won't be able to control it anymore.

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.790
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:12.750
You are about to witness the
illusions of Makoto the Magician!

00:19:18.950 --> 00:19:21.250
Wh-What is this?!

00:19:26.620 --> 00:19:30.290
What do you think you're doing?!
Did you think you can--

00:19:41.290 --> 00:19:44.750
Give that back! It belongs to me!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.620
Muff-<i>kun</i>!

00:20:05.500 --> 00:20:06.330
Hatena!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:08.870
Big sister! Big sister!

00:20:10.040 --> 00:20:11.700
Yumemi...

00:20:13.410 --> 00:20:20.290
Why? Why did you come here?
You knew it was going to be dangerous.

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:23.410
I knew that not coming
was the right thing to do.

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:27.500
But... But I...

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:32.790
...am the sister of Hoshisato Kana--
the master thief Hatena.

00:20:51.620 --> 00:20:53.870
Safe journey.

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:58.290
Ah! Who knew the day would come when
I left for school with Yumemi-<i>sama</i>?

00:20:58.290 --> 00:20:59.830
I must be dreaming!

00:20:59.830 --> 00:21:02.700
That sure was a lot of trouble, huh?

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:07.500
Mm-hmm. Next time, talk to us first,
and make sure not to try to go it alone.

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:11.450
After all, I am your partner.

00:21:13.830 --> 00:21:17.000
Once we've retrieved all
of Maeve-<i>san</i>'s Artifacts,

00:21:17.000 --> 00:21:22.080
you'll join me as my partner as we do
stage shows around the world, right?

00:21:22.080 --> 00:21:26.200
D-Do you mean, the way Father and Mother do?

00:21:26.200 --> 00:21:29.950
Makoto-<i>niisama</i>, I'll give you a hand.

00:21:29.950 --> 00:21:32.660
Having double magicians would be cool.

00:21:32.660 --> 00:21:34.790
I'd be more useful to you than big sister.

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:37.910
Hold on, Yumemi! What's that supposed to mean?!

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:41.200
Mistress Kana, now is the
time to stand your ground!

00:21:41.200 --> 00:21:45.750
If you are beaten out here,
it becomes a slippery slope!

00:21:46.580 --> 00:21:52.370
<i>My path now begins</i>

00:21:52.370 --> 00:22:00.750
<i>I've unleashed the hidden light of one future</i>

00:22:04.540 --> 00:22:07.200
<i>I've been on the hunt</i>

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:11.250
<i>to find my furthest dreams</i>

00:22:11.250 --> 00:22:14.410
<i>I want to shine even brighter</i>

00:22:14.410 --> 00:22:19.500
<i>The "someday" that my former self prayed for</i>

00:22:19.500 --> 00:22:24.660
<i>is still far away, but I'll catch up</i>

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:29.660
<i>"Miracle" is such an embarrassingly vague word</i>

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:34.830
<i>My timeframe has neither forever nor a moment</i>

00:22:34.830 --> 00:22:42.080
<i>I move forward one step at a time to my voice</i>

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:45.910
<i>No matter what awaits me</i>

00:22:45.910 --> 00:22:47.250
<i>beyond this pain</i>

00:22:47.250 --> 00:22:49.500
<i>I'll once again, yes once again</i>

00:22:49.500 --> 00:22:52.250
<i>leap up and shine</i>

00:22:52.250 --> 00:22:56.080
<i>Yeah, I'll put into words</i>

00:22:56.080 --> 00:22:57.620
<i>the view laid out before me</i>

00:22:57.620 --> 00:23:00.870
<i>and let it ring out dozens,</i>

00:23:00.870 --> 00:23:04.540
<i>even hundreds of times</i>

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:08.830
<i>What color do you suppose love is?</i>

00:23:08.830 --> 00:23:14.500
<i>I've unleashed my hidden light</i>

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:19.580
What's wrong, Yumemi-<i>chan</i>?

00:23:20.700 --> 00:23:23.290
I forgot to put on underwear.

00:23:26.620 --> 00:23:28.450
Ah! Wait just a minute!

00:23:28.450 --> 00:23:30.450
Are you skipping school again?!

00:23:32.080 --> 00:23:38.330
"What food do you hate?"

00:23:39.870 --> 00:23:51.950
"Kokomi"

00:23:51.950 --> 00:24:01.910
"See you next time"
